L Video Sitemap.'=>'This process goes through all the post types specified by you, as well as the terms of each taxonomy, to check for videos in the content. If the plugin finds a video, it updates the metadata for that piece of content, so it can add that metadata and content to the XML Video Sitemap.','By default the plugin only checks content that hasn\'t been checked yet. However, if you check \'Force Re-Index\', it will re-check all content. This is particularly interesting if you want to check for a video embed code that wasn\'t supported before, or if you want to update thumbnail images en masse.'=>'By default the plugin only checks content that hasn\'t been checked yet. However, if you check \'Force Re-Index\', it will re-check all content. This is particularly interesting if you want to check for a video embed code that wasn\'t supported before, or if you want to update thumbnail images en masse.','Video Duration'=>'Video Duration','Overwrite the video duration, or enter one if it\'s empty.'=>'Overwrite the video duration, or enter one if it\'s empty.','Set a rating between 0 and 5.'=>'Set a rating between 0 and 5.','Disable Media RSS Enhancement'=>'Disable Media RSS Enhancement','Try to make videos responsive using %1$sFitVids.js%2$s?'=>'Try to make videos responsive using %1$sFitVids.js%2$s?','Please upgrade WordPress to the latest version to allow WordPress and the Video SEO module to work properly.'=>'Please upgrade WordPress to the latest version to allow WordPress and the Video SEO module to work properly.','Please upgrade the %1$s plugin to the latest version to allow the Video SEO module to work.'=>'Please upgrade the %1$s plugin to the latest version to allow the Video SEO module to work.','Add extra tags for this video'=>'Add extra tags for this video','Tags'=>'Tags','Select at least one post type to enable the video sitemap.'=>'Select at least one post type to enable the video sitemap.','Ignore.'=>'Ignore.','The VideoSEO upgrade which was just applied contains a lot of improvements. It is strongly recommended that you %1$sre-index the video content on your website%2$s with the \'force reindex\' option checked.'=>'The VideoSEO upgrade which was just applied contains a lot of improvements. It is strongly recommended that you %1$sre-index the video content on your website%2$s with the \'force reindex\' option checked.','Custom fields'=>'Custom fields','(Optional) Embedly API Key'=>'(Optional) Embedly API Key','The video SEO plugin provides where possible enriched information about your videos. A lot of %1$svideo services%2$s are supported by default. For those services which aren\'t supported, we can try to retrieve enriched video information using %3$sEmbedly%2$s. If you want to use this option, you\'ll need to sign up for a (free) %3$sEmbedly%2$s account and provide the API key you receive.'=>'The video SEO plugin provides, where possible, enriched information about your videos. A lot of %1$svideo services%2$s are supported by default. For those services which aren\'t supported, we can try to retrieve enriched video information using %3$sEmbedly%2$s. If you want to use this option, you\'ll need to sign up for a (free) %3$sEmbedly%2$s account and provide the API key you receive.','Content width'=>'Content width','Wistia domain'=>'Wistia domain','If you use Wistia in combination with a custom domain, set this to the domain name you use for your Wistia videos, no http: or slashes needed.'=>'If you use Wistia in combination with a custom domain, set this to the domain name you use for your Wistia videos, no http: or slashes needed.','Please %1$sinstall & activate %2$s%3$s and then enable its XML sitemap functionality to allow the Video SEO module to work.'=>'Please %1$sinstall & activate %2$s%3$s and then enable its XML sitemap functionality to allow the Video SEO module to work.','The PHP SPL extension seems to be unavailable. Please ask your web host to enable it.'=>'The PHP SPL extension seems to be unavailable. Please ask your web host to enable it.','Indexation of videos in your content'=>'Indexation of videos in your content','Force reindex of already indexed videos.'=>'Force reindex of already indexed videos.','Your site is being indexed at the moment, so don\'t close this window. This process may take a few minutes to complete.'=>'Your site is being indexed at the moment, so don\'t close this window. This process may take a few minutes to complete.','Estimated time to go:'=>'Estimated time to go:','Posts to go:'=>'Posts to go:','Total posts:'=>'Total posts:','Team Yoast'=>'Team Yoast','XML Video Sitemap'=>'XML Video Sitemap','Yoast SEO: Video'=>'Yoast SEO: Video','Please ask the (network) admin to install & activate %1$s and then enable its XML sitemap functionality to allow the Video SEO module to work.'=>'Please ask the (network) admin to install & activate %1$s and then enable its XML sitemap functionality to allow the Video SEO module to work.','Mark this video as not Family-friendly'=>'Mark this video as not Family-friendly','Post Types for which to enable the Video SEO plugin'=>'Post Types for which to enable the Video SEO plugin','Re-indexation'=>'Re-indexation','%1$sDone! Go back to the Video SEO settings%2$s'=>'%1$sDone! Go back to the Video SEO settings%2$s','Activation of Video SEO failed:'=>'Activation of Video SEO failed:','The Yoast Video SEO plugin makes sure your videos are recognized by search engines and social platforms, so they look good when found on these social platforms and in the search results.'=>'The Yoast Video SEO plugin makes sure your videos are recognised by search engines and social platforms, so they look good when found on these social platforms and in the search results.','Disables all Video SEO output for this %s'=>'Disables all Video SEO output for this %s']];